# zt_bug 6971 回写序列（connection_name=新禅道，每步必带）

## 1) 查现状（拿 product/project/execution/openedBy）
mcp_gateway {
  "server": "dbx",
  "tool": "dbx_execute_query",
  "arguments": {
    "connection_name": "新禅道",
    "sql": "SELECT id,status,assignedTo,openedBy,product,project,execution,resolution FROM zt_bug WHERE id=6971;"
  }
}
核验: 记录 openedBy（回写 assignedTo 用）与 product/project/execution 原值

## 2) 开事务 session
mcp_gateway {
  "server": "dbx",
  "tool": "dbx_open_session",
  "arguments": {
    "connection_name": "新禅道",
    "enable_transactions": true
  }
}
核验: 取返回的 session_id，后续所有事务内调用都带它 + connection_name

## 3) begin
mcp_gateway {
  "server": "dbx",
  "tool": "dbx_begin_transaction",
  "arguments": {
    "connection_name": "新禅道",
    "session_id": "<session_id>"
  }
}
核验: 成功后再执行第 4/5 步

## 4) UPDATE zt_bug → resolved
mcp_gateway {
  "server": "dbx",
  "tool": "dbx_execute_query",
  "arguments": {
    "connection_name": "新禅道",
    "sql": "UPDATE zt_bug SET status='resolved', resolution='fixed', resolvedBuild='trunk', resolvedBy='tiany', resolvedDate=NOW(), assignedTo='<openedBy>', lastEditedBy='tiany', lastEditedDate=NOW() WHERE id=6971;",
    "session_id": "<session_id>"
  }
}
核验: affected rows = 1

## 5) INSERT zt_action（14 列，files 挂附件 id 列表或 NULL）
mcp_gateway {
  "server": "dbx",
  "tool": "dbx_execute_query",
  "arguments": {
    "connection_name": "新禅道",
    "sql": "INSERT INTO zt_action (objectType,objectID,product,project,execution,actor,action,date,comment,files,extra,`read`,efforted,vision) VALUES ('bug',6971,'<product>','<project>','<execution>','tiany','resolved',NOW(),'<p><img src=\"{24358.png}\" alt=\"index.php?m=file&amp;f=read&amp;t=png&amp;fileID=24358\" /></p>','24358','fixed',0,0,'rnd');",
    "session_id": "<session_id>"
  }
}
核验: affected rows = 1；product/project/execution 用第 1 步查到的原值；files 为逗号分隔 fileID 或 NULL

## 5b) 把上传的附件 zt_file 挂到 bug（comment 内嵌需要 objectType/objectID 正确）
mcp_gateway {
  "server": "dbx",
  "tool": "dbx_execute_query",
  "arguments": {
    "connection_name": "新禅道",
    "sql": "UPDATE zt_file SET objectType='bug',objectID=6971,addedBy='tiany',addedDate=NOW() WHERE id IN (24358);",
    "session_id": "<session_id>"
  }
}
核验: affected rows = 附件数；objectType='bug' 且 objectID=6971

## 6) 事务内复核
mcp_gateway {
  "server": "dbx",
  "tool": "dbx_execute_query",
  "arguments": {
    "connection_name": "新禅道",
    "sql": "SELECT status,resolution,resolvedBy,resolvedDate,assignedTo FROM zt_bug WHERE id=6971;\nSELECT actor,action FROM zt_action WHERE objectType='bug' AND objectID=6971 ORDER BY id DESC;",
    "session_id": "<session_id>"
  }
}
核验: status=resolved / resolution=fixed / resolvedBy / assignedTo 均符合预期

## 7) commit
mcp_gateway {
  "server": "dbx",
  "tool": "dbx_commit_transaction",
  "arguments": {
    "connection_name": "新禅道",
    "session_id": "<session_id>"
  }
}
核验: 返回 committed 即成功；不再做无 session 的第二次复核

